# Baile na Laje: funk carioca tamborzão. Kick and low tom trade the 3-3-2
# tresillo (steps 1-4-7 | 9-12-15), claps on 2 and 4, a shaker accenting the
# same cells, and a big 808 under the kicks. A high tom (^) answers each bar.
#   street beat --pattern examples/patterns/baile-tamborzao.groove

title   Baile na Laje
bpm     130
swing   54%
key     Am
style   funk
chords  Am | Am | G | G

#         1    2    3    4
kick    | x... .... x... .... |
tom     | ...o ..o. ...o ..^. |
clap    | .... x... .... x..g |
shaker  | xggx ggxg xggx ggxg |
rim     | .... .o.. .... .o.. |
bass    | x... .... x... .... |
